    "created_at": "2019-11-20T08:53:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-11-20T08:54:49Z",
    "body": "The main reason is that there's complicated interactions with the existing behavior of some of these elements. We also haven't properly integrated shadow trees throughout the entire system yet (there's a number of open issues against HTML for instance).\r\n\r\nEdit: nice to see you again too by the way!",
