    "created_at": "2026-07-07T15:38:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-07T15:38:22Z",
    "body": "I don't think we want to extend this list, especially as we sometimes come up with novel use cases for existing elements that then require the introduction of a user agent shadow root (such as with `select` and `option`).",
